        "summary": "修改購物車內容",
        "description": "除非是團主否則只能改自己的\n\nRequest Body:\n\n| 參數名稱                   | 型別  | 必填 | 說明     |\n|------------------------|-----|----|--------|\n| id                     | 數字  | 是  | 商品ID   |\n| title                  | 字串  | 否  | 商品名稱   |\n| price                  | 浮點數 | 否  | 商品價格   |\n| quantity               | 數字  | 是  | 商品數量   |\n| selectedModifierGroups | 陣列  | 否  | 商品選項資訊 |\n| customerToken | String  | 是  | 檢查團主或團員身份 |\n\nselectedModifierGroups內的資訊如下：\n\n| 參數名稱                    | 型別 | 必填 | 說明        |\n|-------------------------|----|----|-----------|\n| title                   | 字串 | 否  | 選項組名稱     |\n| id                      | 數字 | 是  | 選項組ID     |\n| externalId              | 字串 | 否  | 外部選項組ID   |\n| selectedModifierOptions | 陣列 | 是  | 選項組內的選項資訊 |\n\nselectedModifierOptions內的資訊如下：\n\n| 參數名稱                   | 型別  | 必填 | 說明         |\n|------------------------|-----|----|------------|\n| title                  | 字串  | 是  | 選項名稱       |\n| id                     | 數字  | 是  | 選項ID       |\n| externalId             | 字串  | 否  | 外部選項ID     |\n| price                  | 浮點數 | 是  | 選項價格       |\n| selectedModifierGroups | 陣列  | 否  | 選項內的子選項組資訊 |\n\n\nselectedModifierGroups內的資訊與第一層的selectedModifierGroups參數資訊相同。",
        "operationId": "updateCartItems",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "shopId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "商店ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "cartId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "購物車ID"
          },
          {
            "name": "customerCartId",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "團員購物車ID"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "修改購物車內容",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "customerId": {
                      "type": "integer",
                      "example": 10
                    },
                    "customerToken": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": ""
                    },
                    "customCartStatus": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "example": "ready"
                    },
                    "items": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "id": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "example": 74907
                          },
                          "title": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "example": "22南投早餐 Tossed Noodles with Minced Pork Breakfast"
                          },
                          "price": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "example": 90
                          },
                          "quantity": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "example": 1
                          },
                          "selectedModifierGroups": {
                            "type": "array",
                            "items": {
                              "type": "object",
                              "properties": {
                                "title": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "example": "飲料加購"
                                },
                                "id": {
                                  "type": "integer",
                                  "example": 4708
                                },
                                "externalId": {
                                  "type": "string",
                                  "nullable": true
                                },
                                "selectedModifierOptions": {
                                  "type": "array",
                                  "items": {
                                    "type": "object"
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "customerId": 10,
                  "customerToken": "",
                  "customCartStatus": "ready",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "id": 74907,
                      "title": "22南投早餐 Tossed Noodles with Minced Pork Breakfast",
                      "price": 90,
                      "quantity": 1,
                      "selectedModifierGroups": [
                        {
                          "title": "飲料加購",
                          "id": 4708,
                          "externalId": null,
                          "selectedModifierOptions": [
                            {
                              "title": "綠茶",
                              "id": 25654,
                              "externalId": null,
                              "price": 0,
                              "selectedModifierGroups": [
                                {
                                  "id": 4710,
                                  "externalId": null,
                                  "title": "甜度",
                                  "selectedModifierOptions": [
                                    {
                                      "id": 25655,
                                      "externalId": null,
                                      "title": "去冰",
                                      "price": 0
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "認證失敗"
          }
        },
