  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "QCAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "Authorization",
        "description": "QC HMAC-SHA256 認證: `QC <AccessKeyId>:<Base64(HMAC-SHA256(timestamp, SecretKey))>`"
      },
      "Seed": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "Seed",
        "description": "Unix timestamp 用於 HMAC 簽名"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "Error": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "message": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "錯誤訊息"
              },
              "code": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "錯誤代碼"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ShopStatus": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "ONLINE",
              "PAUSED"
            ],
            "description": "商店營業狀態"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "security": [
    {
      "QCAuth": []
    },
    {
      "Seed": []
    }
  ],
  "webhooks": {
    "新訂單建立": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "[Webhook] 新訂單建立",
        "description": "當新訂單產生時, 會觸發此WEBHOOK\n\n```\n{\n    \"eventTs\": 12345678, // unix timestamp\n    \"eventType\": \"order_created\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"orderId\": \"000000001\"\n    }\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Security**\n\nWebhook HTTP請求標頭當中，會有 `X-QC-Signature`，內容值為數位簽章，  \n表示該事件訊息是來自快一點平台\n\n以下為Python範例  \n將 Webhook request body 進⾏ HMAC 運算(空白要去掉)，  \nhash function 使⽤ SHA-256，key 使⽤ client secret。\n\nPython範例:\n\n```\nimport hmac\nimport hashlib\nwebhook_body = '{\"eventType\":\"order_status_changed\",\"eventTs\":1234567890,\"data\":{\"orderId\":\"0000000001\"}}';\ndigester = hmac.new(client_secret, webhook_body, hashlib.sha256)\nreturn digester.hexdigest()\n\n ```",
        "tags": [
          "Webhooks"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "收到通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "訂單狀態改變": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "[Webhook] 訂單狀態改變",
        "description": "訂單狀態改變時, 會觸發此WEBHOOK\n```\n{\n    \"eventTs\": 12345678, // unix timestamp\n    \"eventType\": \"order_status_changed\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"orderId\": \"000000001\"\n    }\n}\n```\n**Security**\n\nWebhook HTTP請求標頭當中，會有 `X-QC-Signature`，內容值為數位簽章，\n表示該事件訊息是來自快一點平台\n\n以下為Python範例\n將 Webhook request body 進⾏ HMAC 運算(空白要去掉)， \nhash function 使⽤ SHA-256，key 使⽤ client secret。\n\nPython範例:\n\n```\nimport hmac\nimport hashlib\nwebhook_body = '{\"eventType\":\"order_status_changed\",\"eventTs\":1234567890,\"data\":{\"orderId\":\"0000000001\"}}';\ndigester = hmac.new(client_secret, webhook_body, hashlib.sha256)\nreturn digester.hexdigest()\n```",
        "tags": [
          "Webhooks"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "收到通知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "結帳狀態改變": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "[Webhook] 結帳狀態改變",
        "description": "當訂單結帳狀態改變時, 會觸發此WEBHOOK\n\n```\n{\n    \"eventTs\": 12345678, // unix timestamp\n    \"eventType\": \"payment_status_changed\",\n    \"data\": {\n        \"orderId\": \"000000001\"\n    }\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Security**\n\nWebhook HTTP請求標頭當中，會有 `X-QC-Signature`，內容值為數位簽章，  \n表示該事件訊息是來自快一點平台\n\n以下為Python範例  \n將 Webhook request body 進⾏ HMAC 運算(空白要去掉)，  \nhash function 使⽤ SHA-256，key 使⽤ client secret。\n\nPython範例:\n\n```\nimport hmac\nimport hashlib\nwebhook_body = '{\"eventType\":\"order_status_changed\",\"eventTs\":1234567890,\"data\":{\"orderId\":\"0000000001\"}}';\ndigester = hmac.new(client_secret, webhook_body, hashlib.sha256)\nreturn digester.hexdigest()\n\n ```",
        "tags": [
          "Webhooks"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "收到通知"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}